{
  "uid": "cloudland-storage",
  "title": "CloudLand 共享存储",
  "description": "GPFS 与 Ceph 存储集群、共享池的曲线（shared-storage-design.md §14.3）。只用于查看，告警来自 clapi 的健康检查。集群按 UUID 选择，UUID 见控制台的存储集群详情。",
  "tags": [
    "cloudland",
    "storage"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "label": "集群",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values(cloudland_storage_cluster_info, cluster)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(cloudland_storage_cluster_info, cluster)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "共享池",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "共享池用量",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (cluster, pool) (cloudland_shared_pool_used_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}) / max by (cluster, pool) (cloudland_shared_pool_size_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\"} > 0) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{pool}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "按共享池 UUID 显示，名称见控制台的存储池列表。数据来自各节点的池探测，所有能访问该池的节点写同样的数字，取最大值。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "能访问共享池的节点数",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (cluster, pool) (cloudland_shared_pool_up{cluster=~\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pool}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "各节点的池探测结果（挂载正常、能读写）相加；少于该池的节点数说明有节点访问不了。"
    },
    {
